}

docs {
  ## Get All Trips

  Retrieves a comprehensive list of all trips in the system with passenger details, status, and driver assignments.

  ### Response
  ```json
  [
    {
      "trip_id": 1,
      "pickup_location": "123 Main St, Bulawayo",
      "dropoff_location": "456 Elm St, Bulawayo",
      "passenger_name": "John Smith",
      "passenger_phone": "0771234567",
      "passenger_email": "john@example.com",
      "status": "Pending",
      "created_at": "2024-01-01T10:00:00.000Z",
      "pickup_time": null,
      "dropoff_time": null,
      "distance_km": null,
      "estimated_duration_minutes": null,
      "actual_duration_minutes": null,
      "fare": null,
      "tip_amount": null,
      "notes": "VIP customer",
      "driver_id": 7
    }
  ]
  ```

  ### Status Values
  - `Pending`: Trip created, waiting for driver assignment
  - `In Progress`: Driver assigned and en route
  - `Completed`: Trip finished successfully
  - `Cancelled`: Trip cancelled

  ### Test Script
  ```javascript
  if (res.getStatus() === 200) {
    const trips = res.getBody();
    console.log(`✅ Retrieved ${trips.length} trips`);

    // Count trips by status
    const statusCount = trips.reduce((acc, trip) => {
      acc[trip.status] = (acc[trip.status] || 0) + 1;
      return acc;
    }, {});

    console.log('Trip status summary:', statusCount);
  }
  ```
}